   </strong>
  </div>

  <div>
   🏠 Rent outstanding:
   <strong style="color:var(--gold)">
    ${money(c.rentPending)}
   </strong>
  </div>

  <div style="
   margin-top:5px;
   padding:12px;
   border-radius:10px;
